<Slide notes={`把一次筹备任务从头到尾拆成五段，看清每一段落在谁身上。

用户提出筹备任务，这一段给出的是要求和约束。接着是宿主应用，它组织上下文、调用模型、控制执行。第三段是 MCP 客户端，它发现能力、发送调用、接收结果。第四段是 MCP 服务端，它校验参数、读取预约、返回业务结果。最后落到预约材料 availability.json 上。

第三段和第四段之间走的是 stdio 或者 Streamable HTTP，这是传输方式的选择。

这条链路能帮我们定位问题：任务描述不全看第一段；上下文错了看第二段；连接和调用出错看第三段；参数没校验、规则判错看第四段；材料和事实对不上，回头核对第五段。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.6.1　端到端分工</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>一次筹备任务经过的五段</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>① 用户提出筹备任务</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>给出要求与约束</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>这一段的产物是要什么、不能违反什么、最后交什么</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text></Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>② 宿主应用</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>组织上下文、调用模型、控制执行</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>把材料、历史和工具描述整理成这一次请求的内容</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#276FBF' }}>↓</Text></Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>③ MCP 客户端</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>发现能力、发送调用、接收结果</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>一个服务由一条连接维护，请求从这里发出去</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>↓　stdio 或 Streamable HTTP</Text></Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, background: '#26816B' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>④ MCP 服务端</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>校验参数、读取预约、返回业务结果</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>业务规则在这一段真正生效，参数不合规要报错</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text></Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 48, background: '#26816B' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>⑤ 预约材料</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>availability.json</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>日期、开放时间与已占用区间，是只读查询的返回值</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.6　MCP：让工具以共同的方式接入应用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>08 / 27</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
